  "notes": "Smoke Tester 2.3.172 fixes the false low-battery shutdown and five-second red shutdown blink around 35%. The emergency cutoff is restored to the original HW3 empty-cell boundary of 3.20 V and is independent from the 3.50 V liquid-evaluation quality gate. Shutdown now also requires a reported level of 5% or less plus five distinct idle ADC samples over at least two seconds after the existing post-generation recovery window; generation, probes, charging, or a recovered sample cancel the candidate.",
